边，右边的小人也转头看向左边，两人在骑行中温柔对视，微笑。接着，两人同时慢慢转回头直视前方，继续保持骑行。停顿一秒后，两人突然同时爆发出疯狂的大笑，笑得前仰后合，身体剧烈晃动，张大嘴巴露出牙齿。大笑过程中，双手始终紧紧握着自行车车把，完全没有离开车把，没有任何捂肚子的动作，只有上半身和头部在剧烈晃动。 背景是波光粼粼的大海和巨树，3D卡通风格，喜剧效果，动作富有弹性。", "768p", "10", false, 1118281150, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"name": "first_frame", "link": 1, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 2, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "label": "duration", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "RH_MinimaxH3MaxTurboImageToVideo", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [340.4009704589844, 248], "pos": [0, 592], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_MinimaxH3MaxTurboImageToVideo"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4244.16357421875, 188.47705078125], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-1557.081787109375, -532.1699829101562], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 14, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀